SET S TO SHIP.
LOCK STEERING TO RETROGRADE.
WAIT 60.
STAGE.
WAIT 60.
STAGE.
LOCK STEERING TO SRFRETROGRADE.
WAIT UNTIL S:ALTITUDE < 35000.
UNLOCK STEERING.
WAIT UNTIL S:ALTITUDE < 6400.
STAGE.
WAIT UNTIL S:ALTITUDE < 3500.
S:PARTS[3]:GETMODULE("RealChuteModule"):DOACTION("cut chute",TRUE).
WAIT UNTIL S:ALTITUDE < 3000.
STAGE.
WAIT UNTIL S:ALTITUDE < 5.
S:PARTS[5]:GETMODULEBYINDEX(0):DOACTION("toggle landing bag",TRUE).